    "created_at": "2020-11-30T14:30:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-11-30T14:30:53Z",
    "body": "The reason we required COEP is to ensure there is consent from nested documents on this difference in keying, right? And `same-origin-allow-popups` would allow you to impact non-consenting popups.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
