    "updated_at": "2020-12-02T16:50:51Z",
    "body": "Cross-origin isolated is for all the agent clusters in a browsing context group. Origin isolation is for a specific agent cluster. OP seems to be talking about the former. The latter seems more reasonable.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
