    "created_at": "2020-12-02T17:01:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-02T17:01:59Z",
    "body": "Sure, but since that hint is really up to the browser and an implementation detail in a way, I think they should use the exact same infrastructure specification-wise.",
